{"rpid": "264909918", "root": "0", "parent": "0", "uname": "钦吉托Cingeto", "mid": "1690747", "level": 6, "vip": 1, "content": "重新集合一下所有的英文.打问号的那一句不是很确定shoots用哪个意思会比较合理.\n开头：\nBetter be the head of a cat than a tail of lion.【宁做鸡头不当凤尾】\nProsperity makes friends, adversity tries them.【富贵交友易，患难见真情】\nAfter it leaves, happiness shoots light.【它离开后，幸福…(??)光?】(p.s.似乎是一句英国谚语但只有日站才看得见我也不会翻x)\nBetter bend than break.【宁曲不断】\nHope of the best, but prepare for the worst【做最好的准备，做最坏的打算】\n————————————————————————————————\n大爷处【魔法阵外两圈】\nAfter it leaves, happiness shoots light. 【???】\nWherever you go, don’t forget your real name that take you new world.【无论你去往何处, 都不要忘记带你去新世界的真名.】\nCongratulations to you finally arrived at the cloud-cuckoo-land.【祝贺你最后到达了脱离现实的幻境】 \nFall down down down and find you.【不断坠落并寻找到你】 \n感觉再里面就是国花与国石的对应了啊...。_。", "like": 38, "ctime": 1495426987, "rcount": 1, "ip": "", "images": [], "video_aid": "523151", "video_bvid": "BV15x411c7s9", "video_title": "【APH/手书】孑然眉毛", "video_desc": "sm20506358 作者→冬季 米团怒刷存在[∂]ω[∂] ", "video_owner": "阿亚蓝", "video_view": 10492, "video_reply": 98, "video_n1": 39, "video_n2": 58}
